msgid "cuda.tile.load"
msgstr "cuda.tile.load"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:1 of
msgid "Loads a tile from the `array` which is partitioned into a |tile space|."
msgstr "从已划分为 |tile space| 的数组中加载一个 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:3 of
msgid ""
"The |tile space| is the result of partitioning the `array` into a grid of"
" equally sized tiles specified by `shape`."
msgstr "|tile space| 是将 ``array`` 按 ``shape`` 指定大小划分为等大 Tile 网格后得到的结果。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:6 of
msgid ""
"For example, partitoning a 2D `array` of shape ``(M, N)`` using tile "
"shape ``(tm, tn)`` results in a 2D tile space of size ``(cdiv(M, tm), "
"cdiv(N, tn))``. An index into this tile space using index ``(i, j)`` "
"produces a tile of size ``(tm, tn)``::"
msgstr ""
"例如，使用 ``(tm, tn)`` 的 Tile 形状对形状为 ``(M, N)`` 的二维 ``array`` 进行分块，会得到大小为 "
"``(cdiv(M, tm), cdiv(N, tn))`` 的二维 Tile 空间。使用索引 ``(i, j)`` 访问该 Tile "
"空间将得到大小为 ``(tm, tn)`` 的 Tile： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:12 cuda.tile._stub.load:25 of
msgid "The result tile `t` will be computed according to ::"
msgstr "结果 Tile ``t`` 将按如下方式计算： ::"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:16 of
msgid ""
"For a tile that partially extends beyond the array boundaries, out-of-"
"bound elements are filled according to `padding_mode`. If the tile lies "
"entirely outside the array, the behavior is undefined."
msgstr "对于部分超出数组边界的 Tile，越界元素将根据 ``padding_mode`` 进行填充。若 Tile 完全位于数组边界之外，则行为未定义。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:20 of
msgid ""
