"example of the above call to `load` would be::"
msgstr "``order`` 用于将 Tile 的轴映射到数组的轴。上述 ``load`` 调用的转置示例如下： ::"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.load.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:31 of
msgid "The |array| to load from."
msgstr "要加载数据的 |array| 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:33 of
msgid "An index in the |tile space| of ``shape`` from ``array``."
msgstr "按 ``shape`` 划分 ``array`` 所得到的 |tile space| 中的索引。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:35 of
msgid "A tuple of const integers definining the shape of the tile."
msgstr "定义 Tile 形状的常量整数元组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:37 of
msgid ""
"Permutation applied to array axes before the logical |tile space| is "
"constructed. Can be specified either as a tuple of constants, or as one "
"of the two special string literal values:  * \"C\" is an alias for ``(0, "
"1, 2, ...)``, i.e. no permutation applied; * \"F\" is an alias for "
"``(..., 2, 1, 0)``, i.e. axis order is reversed."
msgstr ""

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:37 of
msgid ""
"Permutation applied to array axes before the logical |tile space| is "
"constructed. Can be specified either as a tuple of constants, or as one "
"of the two special string literal values:"
msgstr "在构建逻辑 |tile space| 之前应用于数组各轴的排列顺序。既可以指定为常量元组，也可以指定为以下两个特殊字符串字面量之一："

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:41 of
msgid "\"C\" is an alias for ``(0, 1, 2, ...)``, i.e. no permutation applied;"
msgstr "``\"C\"`` 是 ``(0, 1, 2, ...)`` 的别名，即不应用轴重排；"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:42 of
msgid "\"F\" is an alias for ``(..., 2, 1, 0)``, i.e. axis order is reversed."
msgstr "``\"F\"`` 是 ``(..., 2, 1, 0)`` 的别名，即反转轴顺序。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:44 of
msgid ""
"The value used to pad the tile when it extends beyond the array "
"boundaries. By default, the padding value is undetermined."
msgstr "当 Tile 超出数组边界时用于填充越界位置的值。默认情况下，填充值为未确定值（undetermined）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:47 of
msgid ""
"Whether to bounds-check the tile against the array boundaries. When "
"``False``, the tile is assumed to stay fully within bounds and the out-"
"of-bounds check is skipped, producing a faster load; violating this "
"assumption is undefined behavior. Since no out-of-bound elements can "
"occur in this case, ``padding_mode`` is ignored. Defaults to ``True``. "
"Setting it to ``False`` requires tileiras 13.4+."
msgstr ""
"是否针对数组边界对 Tile 执行边界检查。设为 ``False`` 时，将假定 Tile "
"完全位于边界之内并跳过越界检查，从而提升加载性能；违反该假设将导致未定义行为。由于此时不会出现越界元素， ``padding_mode`` "
"将被忽略。默认为 ``True`` 。将其设为 ``False`` 需要 tileiras 13.4+。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:53 of
msgid ""
"A hint indicating how heavy DRAM traffic will be. It shall be an integer "
"between 1 (low) and 10 (high). By default, the compiler will infer the "
"latency."
msgstr "指示 DRAM 访存负载强度的提示值，应为 1（低）到 10（高）之间的整数。默认由编译器自动推断。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:56 of
msgid "If False, the load will not use TMA. By default, TMA is allowed."
msgstr "若为 False，该加载操作不会使用 TMA。默认允许使用 TMA。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:58 of
msgid ""
"Memory ordering semantics for the load. Defaults to ``MemoryOrder.WEAK``."
" Valid values: ``WEAK``, ``RELAXED``, ``ACQUIRE``."
msgstr ""
"加载操作的内存序语义。默认为 ``MemoryOrder.WEAK`` 。有效值： ``WEAK`` 、 ``RELAXED`` 、 "
"``ACQUIRE`` 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.load:61 of
msgid ""
"The scope of threads that participate in memory ordering. Only meaningful"
" when ``memory_order`` is not ``WEAK``."
msgstr "参与内存排序的线程作用域。仅当 ``memory_order`` 不为 ``WEAK`` 时生效。"

